SKJÁR licensing
===============

Copyright (c) 2026 hringdrifi

This repository contains hardware designs, software, and documentation.
Each part is released under a different license:

- Hardware design files (schematics, PCB layouts, enclosure designs)
  are licensed under the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 -
  Strongly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-S-2.0).
  See LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt.

- Software (firmware, UI applications, scripts)
  is licensed under the MIT License.
  See LICENSES/MIT.txt.

- Documentation (README.md and files under docs/)
  is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
  International License (CC BY-SA 4.0).
  See LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt.

Third-party materials (datasheets, drawings, certification reports, and
other documents published by their respective owners) are NOT included
in this repository. docs/references/README.md only links to their
original sources and summarizes the facts used in the design.
